  "limits": [
    "Assumes the indexed g coordinates satisfy CoordinateBound and initial sums satisfy the k-cap input envelope, with k \u2264 3 and k+d \u2264 4.",
    "Pins m31FromBytes and wideToLimbs to retained concrete parser and limb-conversion owners.",
    "Proves actual v6 term-body success entails the prior eight-segment loop success and bound, then actual v6 term-loop success entails the (k+d)*cap envelope.",
    "The end/stride/iterator behavior is taken from the emitted RangeIter operations in this term loop; no outer seven-batch or public four_dots caller theorem is included.",
    "Candidate proof checkpoint only; no production source adoption implied. No binaries included.",
    "New loop theorem composes new v6 term-loop success to the prior old-loop body/loop proof; it does not yet establish the complete outer four_dots seven-batch caller. StepBy source default is reused separately."
  ],
